    "Blood oxygen dipped below your norm. Go gently until it recovers." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blood oxygen dipped below your norm. Go gently until it recovers."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血氧含量低于平时。恢复前建议放轻松。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blood oxygen dipped slightly, though overall readiness is prime." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blood oxygen dipped slightly, though overall readiness is prime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血氧含量略低，但整体状态依然很好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blood oxygen estimates the percentage of oxygen carried by your blood. It is usually fairly steady at rest, and fit or motion can affect readings. Repeated low readings, sudden drops, or low values with shortness of breath, chest pain, or confusion need medical attention." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blood oxygen estimates the percentage of oxygen carried by your blood. It is usually fairly steady at rest, and fit or motion can affect readings. Repeated low readings, sudden drops, or low values with shortness of breath, chest pain, or confusion need medical attention."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血氧估算血液中携带氧气的百分比。静息时通常相当稳定，佩戴松紧和动作可能影响读数。反复出现的低读数、突然下降，或伴有气短、胸痛、意识模糊的低数值，需要就医。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blood oxygen is a touch low, yet overall readiness is high." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blood oxygen is a touch low, yet overall readiness is high."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血氧含量略低，但整体状态仍然不错。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blood oxygen is below its usual range." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blood oxygen is below its usual range."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血氧低于日常范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blood oxygen is below your norm, nudging readiness to moderate. Keep load controlled." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blood oxygen is below your norm, nudging readiness to moderate. Keep load controlled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血氧含量低于平时，整体状态降到中等。训练负荷建议收着点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blood oxygen is notably low. Take it very easy until it recovers." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blood oxygen is notably low. Take it very easy until it recovers."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血氧含量明显偏低。恢复前建议保持很低强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blood oxygen readings" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blood oxygen readings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血氧读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BMI is a weight-to-height calculation used as a broad screening measure. It does not distinguish fat, muscle, bone, or body shape, so it is best treated as context rather than a diagnosis. Compare it with weight, body fat, activity, and your personal goals." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BMI is a weight-to-height calculation used as a broad screening measure. It does not distinguish fat, muscle, bone, or body shape, so it is best treated as context rather than a diagnosis. Compare it with weight, body fat, activity, and your personal goals."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体重指数是一种体重与身高的换算，用作粗略的筛查指标。它无法区分脂肪、肌肉、骨骼或体型，因此更适合作为参考而非诊断。可结合体重、体脂率、活动量和个人目标一起看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Body fat percentage estimates how much of your body mass is fat tissue. Consumer scales and devices can vary with hydration, skin temperature, and measurement timing, so the trend is more useful than one reading. Compare it alongside weight and how you feel." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Body fat percentage estimates how much of your body mass is fat tissue. Consumer scales and devices can vary with hydration, skin temperature, and measurement timing, so the trend is more useful than one reading. Compare it alongside weight and how you feel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体脂率估算体重中脂肪组织所占的比例。消费级体脂秤和设备的读数会随水分、皮肤温度和测量时间波动，因此趋势比单次读数更有价值。可结合体重和自身感受一起参考。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
