    "Heart rate, HRV, and recovery" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heart rate, HRV, and recovery"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心率、心率变异性与恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heart rate is the number of beats per minute measured throughout the day. Daily ranges can shift with sleep, workouts, stress, caffeine, illness, heat, and readiness. Compare the range with your sleep and workout timing before judging a single spike." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heart rate is the number of beats per minute measured throughout the day. Daily ranges can shift with sleep, workouts, stress, caffeine, illness, heat, and readiness. Compare the range with your sleep and workout timing before judging a single spike."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心率是全天测得的每分钟心跳次数。每日范围会随睡眠、运动、压力、咖啡因、疾病、炎热和恢复状态而变化。在判断某次心率飙升之前，先将其与睡眠和训练时间对照来看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heart rate variability measures the small timing changes between heartbeats. Higher than your usual baseline often points to better readiness and lower strain; lower than usual can follow hard training, poor sleep, alcohol, illness, or stress. Compare trends over weeks instead of judging one day by itself." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heart rate variability measures the small timing changes between heartbeats. Higher than your usual baseline often points to better readiness and lower strain; lower than usual can follow hard training, poor sleep, alcohol, illness, or stress. Compare trends over weeks instead of judging one day by itself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心率变异性衡量心跳之间的细微时间变化。高于日常基准通常代表更好的恢复状态和更低的负担；低于日常水平则可能出现在高强度训练、睡眠不佳、饮酒、疾病或压力之后。请以数周的趋势为准，不要只看某一天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heart signals compared with your baseline." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heart signals compared with your baseline."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心脏信号与自身基准的对比。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
