    "Readiness" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Readiness"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Readiness combines your recent heart, sleep, training, and overnight vital signs against your own baseline. It is a readiness estimate, not a diagnosis. The strongest signal comes from sustained patterns across HRV, resting heart rate, sleep quality, and recent load rather than one isolated reading.\nToday's live score updates through the day and drops after a workout, while the trend chart keeps the value from shortly after you wake, so the current score can read lower than today's point on the chart." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Readiness combines your recent heart, sleep, training, and overnight vital signs against your own baseline. It is a readiness estimate, not a diagnosis. The strongest signal comes from sustained patterns across HRV, resting heart rate, sleep quality, and recent load rather than one isolated reading.\nToday's live score updates through the day and drops after a workout, while the trend chart keeps the value from shortly after you wake, so the current score can read lower than today's point on the chart."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复状态将近期的心脏、睡眠、训练和夜间生命体征与自身基准综合比较。它只是恢复状态估算，并非诊断。最有价值的信号来自心率变异性、静息心率、睡眠质量和近期负荷的持续变化趋势，而非某一次孤立的读数。\n今天的实时评分会随一天的进行不断更新，并在运动后下降；而趋势图保留的是醒来后不久的数值，因此当前评分可能低于图表上今天的数据点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Readiness is lagging. Favor easy work or rest." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Readiness is lagging. Favor easy work or rest."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复状态偏低，宜安排轻松训练或休息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Readiness is prime even with HRV a touch under baseline — you're primed to train." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Readiness is prime even with HRV a touch under baseline — you're primed to train."
