    "Skin Temperature shows changes captured during sleep from supported devices. It is most useful as a trend against your own baseline. Shifts can follow room temperature, illness, alcohol, menstrual cycle changes, travel, or wearable fit." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skin Temperature shows changes captured during sleep from supported devices. It is most useful as a trend against your own baseline. Shifts can follow room temperature, illness, alcohol, menstrual cycle changes, travel, or wearable fit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "皮肤温度显示受支持设备在睡眠期间记录的变化。它最适合作为与自身基准对比的趋势来看。变化可能与室温、疾病、饮酒、月经周期变化、旅行或佩戴松紧有关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
