    "Time In Daylight estimates how long supported devices detected outdoor daylight exposure. Daylight can support circadian rhythm, mood, and sleep timing, but readings depend on device support and whether the device was worn." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Time In Daylight estimates how long supported devices detected outdoor daylight exposure. Daylight can support circadian rhythm, mood, and sleep timing, but readings depend on device support and whether the device was worn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日照时间估算受支持设备检测到的户外日光暴露时长。日光有助于昼夜节律、情绪和睡眠时间安排，但读数取决于设备支持情况以及是否佩戴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today's activity was light, so your moderate readiness mainly reflects your recovery signals. Keep the load controlled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today's activity was light, so your moderate readiness mainly reflects your recovery signals. Keep the load controlled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天只是轻度活动，中等状态主要反映身体的恢复信号。注意控制负荷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today's sleep data isn't in yet. Get some rest and check back later for a more accurate result." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today's sleep data isn't in yet. Get some rest and check back later for a more accurate result."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的睡眠数据还没同步，好好休息，稍后再回来查看更准确的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today's workout brought readiness from high down to low. That was a considerable session, so rest and recover fully for the rest of the day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today's workout brought readiness from high down to low. That was a considerable session, so rest and recover fully for the rest of the day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的运动让身体状态从良好降至偏低，这是不小的消耗。今天余下的时间请充分休息和恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today's workout has lowered your readiness. This is training load, not under recovery. Focus on resting for the rest of the day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today's workout has lowered your readiness. This is training load, not under recovery. Focus on resting for the rest of the day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的运动拉低了状态，这是训练消耗，并非恢复不足。今天建议休息为主。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today's workout took some energy out of you, but readiness is still high. You can carry on with your training." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today's workout took some energy out of you, but readiness is still high. You can carry on with your training."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的运动消耗了一些精力，但状态依然良好，后续的训练依然可以继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today's workout was very demanding, taking readiness from an exceptional state all the way down to a low point. That's a big training load, so some active recovery for the rest of the day would help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today's workout was very demanding, taking readiness from an exceptional state all the way down to a low point. That's a big training load, so some active recovery for the rest of the day would help."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的运动强度非常大，从极其出色的状态一路降至低谷。这是相当大的训练消耗，接下来的时间进行一些主动恢复会更有帮助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
