            "value" : "训练"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Training Load compares acute training load with chronic training load. Acute load is a 7-day exponentially weighted average of workout strain, while chronic load is a 42-day weighted average that reflects your adapted baseline. Values near 0.80-1.30 are usually the most sustainable; sustained values above that range can point to higher readiness demand." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Training Load compares acute training load with chronic training load. Acute load is a 7-day exponentially weighted average of workout strain, while chronic load is a 42-day weighted average that reflects your adapted baseline. Values near 0.80-1.30 are usually the most sustainable; sustained values above that range can point to higher readiness demand."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "训练负荷比较短期训练负荷与长期训练负荷。短期负荷是训练强度的 7 天指数加权平均值，长期负荷是反映身体已适应基准的 42 天加权平均值。0.80-1.30 附近的数值通常最可持续；持续高于该范围可能意味着对恢复状态的更高要求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Training load has outpaced recovery — readiness is low. Back off and rest." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Training load has outpaced recovery — readiness is low. Back off and rest."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "训练负荷已经超过恢复节奏，今天状态很低。建议减量并休息。"
